  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="37">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 37</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be leasre gewitnesse. And gyf hwa on leasre gewitnysse openlice stande ⁊ he oferstæled wurðe, ne stande his gewitnysse syððan for naht, ac gylde ðam cynge oððe landrican be halsfange.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning false witness. And if anyone has given testimony which is manifestly false, and is convicted thereof, his testimony henceforth shall be valueless, and he shall pay to the king or to the lord of the manor a sum equivalent to his healsfang.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gyf hwa on leasre gewitnesse openlice stande ⁊ he oferstæled weorðe, ne stande his gewitnes syððan for aht, ac gylde þam cingce oððe landrican (þe his socne ahe) be healsfange.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
